==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Retsu Kaioh (Enemy)|Retsu Kaioh]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark counters]] to deal with the Doge Darks. Retsu himself is not too difficult to deal with using fast units.

